.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdfm 1  "mdfm v0.1.1" 
.SH NAME
mdfm \- jq for Markdown frontmatter: query, mutate, delete, and validate YAML and TOML frontmatter
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdfm\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-l\fR|\fB\-\-files\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-where\fR] [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-ext\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
jq for Markdown frontmatter: query, mutate, delete, and validate YAML and TOML frontmatter
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Frontmatter format used when creating new frontmatter (yaml or toml)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
yaml
.IP \(bu 2
toml
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Output presentation format (table, json, plain, or files)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
table
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
plain
.IP \(bu 2
files
.RE
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-files\-only\fR
Print only matching file paths, one per line (shorthand for \-\-output files)
.TP
\fB\-\-where\fR \fI<EXPR>\fR
Optional filter expression (e.g. \*(Aqdraft == true\*(Aq, \*(Aqnot has_frontmatter\*(Aq, \*(Aqfrontmatter_format == "toml"\*(Aq, \*(Aq`prep time` != null\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to explicit configuration file override (TOML, YAML, or JSON)
.TP
\fB\-\-ext\fR \fI<EXT>\fR
File extensions to include when walking directories (repeatable or comma\-separated; defaults to md,markdown)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
mdfm\-get(1)
Query one or more frontmatter keys (dot paths, comma\-separated, \-k/\-\-key, or \*(Aq.\*(Aq for full frontmatter)
.TP
mdfm\-set(1)
Update, insert, or mutate array frontmatter keys (creates frontmatter using default_format if absent)
.TP
mdfm\-del(1)
Delete one or more keys from frontmatter
.TP
mdfm\-mv(1)
Rename or merge a frontmatter key across files
.TP
mdfm\-check(1)
Validate frontmatter syntax and optionally against a JSON Schema
.TP
mdfm\-keys(1)
Audit frontmatter keys, file counts, and observed types across files
.TP
mdfm\-values(1)
Audit unique values and occurrence counts for a frontmatter key across files
.TP
mdfm\-fmt(1)
Format and normalize frontmatter style (indentation, key/array sorting, YAML/TOML conversion)
.TP
mdfm\-completions(1)
Generate shell completion scripts (bash, zsh, fish, powershell, elvish)
.TP
mdfm\-man(1)
Generate UNIX roff man page
.TP
mdfm\-update(1)
Check for and install the latest mdfm release from GitHub
.TP
mdfm\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
vv0.1.1
